{
  "$comment": "The portal database: two Google spreadsheets, one tab per table, row 1 = these headers (docs/specs/portal.md section 6). Shared by the app (lib/portal/schema.ts), the seed script and the Sheets setup script. Encrypted columns hold v1:<iv>:<ciphertext>:<tag>. Sign-in secrets live in the Vault (Clinician_Auth), never in the coordinator-editable Operations sheet. Revised after the fresh review (spec section 14).",
